{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18d3_level_act18d3_02_end",
  "groupId": "act18d3",
  "stageId": "act18d3_02",
  "title": "歌手",
  "storyCode": "SV-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "55058dacf62ace71596a0d7418912edc4571e2db2c37bfc98fd12f19df0d8584",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......你、你好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "嗯？還有一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "別，別動手......我和他們不大一樣。我知道你是好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你能明白我的意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你只是跟著長凳來這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "嗚，嗚嗚......木框，木框......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "他跑，我跟著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你對我們沒有惡意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "只要他把我的東西還給我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "長、長凳......你拿了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "亮亮......亮亮......硬......痛痛......嗚嗚嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "這個不能吃呀！快，快從嘴裡拿出來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "抱歉，長凳看到沒見過的東西就想用手拿。他不懂這東西他不該拿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（接過項鍊）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "呃，全是口水......你的手都弄髒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "拿回來就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "這裡不常見陌生面孔。你是從外面來的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我從其他伊比利亞城市來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "我很少見到別的地方來的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你這身衣服......也很奇怪。我從沒見過這種料子。外面的人都穿成這樣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "流浪歌手才這麼穿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "流浪......歌手？我聽到你對鐵皮他們說了，但我不知道那是什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "像我這樣到處走，偶爾停下來，彈彈琴，唱唱歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "這箱子裡呢，裝的是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "薩克斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "薩克斯是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "樂器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你真的是個流浪歌手？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "（小聲嘀咕）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "那你是來做什麼的呢？唱歌嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我是來找人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "那個人是誰？也是一位流浪歌手嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "是的。她是我的夥伴，我們是同僚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "她也來了鹽風城？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "對。你見過她嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你還沒說她長什麼樣子呢......算啦！我剛才也說過了，像你這樣的人，我以前從來沒見過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我去問其他人。你能帶路嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "帶路？那個陷阱......是我做的。我以為你知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "無所謂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你不怪我？我還以為你至少會......也教訓我一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "走吧。我趕時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "怎、怎麼突然停下來......撞在箱子上了，痛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "忘了說。我箱子裡面的東西，對你沒用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "除了這個，你想要什麼，幫我找到人，我都可以給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "呃，我只是好奇......有那麼明顯嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "和你做的陷阱一樣顯而易見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "哇......歌手，你不光有一雙靈巧的手，你還有一雙厲害的眼睛啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民",
      "text": "九十八......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民",
      "text": "九十九......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你們這裡，怎麼問問題？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "咦？你在外面一般怎麼問？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（砰一聲放下背上箱子）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "用這個問。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "啊？薩......薩克斯？你用樂器問問題？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "砰砰，咚，啪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "......這個樂器的聲音還挺奇怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "很有效率。一般他們都會馬上開口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "還不說的話，可以換個角度，再來一輪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "那我懷疑在這裡行不通哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（摸箱子）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "要不然，剛才那兩個，已經開口了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "鐵皮嗎？他們應該都不知道樂器。這裡的人，通常只做自己的事，不怎麼搭理人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "而且他們，呃，很少說話。就算知道，他們也不懂怎麼回答。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你理我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "......可能因為我這人有點怪，我和大家都不太一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你的話說得也比他們好很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "是這樣嗎？我好高興。這都是佩特拉奶奶教我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "對了，你想找人再問問的話，我可以帶你去找佩特拉奶奶。她是我們這裡年紀最大的人，知道的事情也最多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "來吧，歌手，走這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民",
      "text": "九十九、九十九......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民",
      "text": "九十九。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你是說他們？不用管他們，他們只是站著。路是擠了一點，但你不小心碰到他們也沒事，他們不會有什麼反應，是吧，桌腳？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "哎？跳起來——從頭頂過去了？這、這是怎麼做到的？完全沒碰到底下的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "外面的人都是這麼走路的嗎？真神奇啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "到啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "佩特拉奶奶！佩——特——拉奶奶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "別叫喚這麼大聲，你是想把我的耳朵震壞嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "嘿嘿，奶奶，您今天看起來真有精神呀！您還是在——呃，曬太陽嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "太陽......呵，哪裡來的太陽。我等了這麼多年，都再也沒瞧見太陽。安妮塔，你又在做什麼？你總是跑來跑去的，像有什麼了不起的事一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "......在這裡，還能有什麼要緊事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "佩特拉奶奶，我沒什麼事，是有別人要找您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "——咦，人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你怎麼一眨眼就跑這裡來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "有人在看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "是嗎？哪裡呀？我怎麼沒瞧見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "那個人藏得很好。只是，還不夠好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你為什麼這麼嚴肅？你不是個流浪歌手嗎？要表演的話，應該很習慣被別人盯著看吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......你說得對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "那我們過去吧！佩特拉奶奶精神不錯，說不定你真能問到些什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "天上的紅霞，映著我火紅的衣裳......心愛的人啊，帶我飛過藍色的海洋......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "佩特拉奶奶，您又在做什麼呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "安妮塔，噢，討厭的安妮塔！沒看見我在跳舞嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "一個女孩子在跳舞的時候，沒有人能打擾她。你要一起來嗎，安妮塔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "我......我不會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "您慢點轉，待會可別又頭暈啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "胡說！我怎麼會頭暈？我能一口氣轉上十來圈，全城的人都會為我鼓掌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "我......咳咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "您歇一會，看看我們這位流浪歌手吧。她有問題要問您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "流浪歌手？我幾十年沒見過什麼流浪歌手了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "這日光......這日光也太長了。夜晚怎麼還不到。等天黑了，酒吧裡就會有人彈琴......你是不是也會去彈琴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "我們在廣場上跳舞，對，就在這裡......噢，我可以連著轉無數個圈。我有一條紅色的裙子，姑娘，我得說，比你身上的這條漂亮多啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "好多小夥子都想和我一起跳。在他們當中，我最喜歡曼紐爾，他年輕時候最英俊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "是的，佩特拉奶奶，您和我說過這些，說過好幾遍啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "再說說看，誰要找我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "是你啊，你這條紅色的裙子，可真漂亮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "紅色的......不，我不要......我不要紅色的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "海水！海水是活的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "糟糕，又開始了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "......突然就湧了上來。都死了！好好的......好好的那麼多人。活下來的人也沒有吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "曼紐爾......曼紐爾他本來說要帶我走。後來他反悔啦。他說那些出去的人都沒回來，他們都死在了外面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "這一段您也說過的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "再後來他說要保護我。他答應我的——他說要保護我！可是他只是想騙我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "他要把我藏起來的吃的都騙走——咳咳，我假裝答應了他，撿起了我母親留下的銀花瓶——咳咳咳咳——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "紅色的......我喜歡紅色的......不，我不要......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "佩特拉奶奶，佩特拉奶奶！您別說這些了，只要一說這些，您就會喘不過氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "今天我帶人來找您，是想問別的問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "問問題？誰要問問題？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "是她，一位外面來的流浪歌手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "]"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你要找什麼人，快點問呀！趁佩特拉奶奶現在還有力氣回答你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你好——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "你是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "流浪歌手。我想找一個人，她和我一樣，也是從外面來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "外面的——外面的人！你胡說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "根本沒有什麼外面的人會來這裡，他們早就不管我們了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "你是來搶我東西的對不對？你要搶走我的食物，搶走我的衣服，你要吃我的肉、喝我的血——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "怪物！你這個怪物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（皺眉）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "奶奶，這裡沒有怪物。她只是個流浪歌手呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "紅色的裙擺......紅色的......我找到了，在這裡......歌聲響起來了......曼紐爾在等我，我要走啦，該走啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "......心愛的人啊，映著我火紅的衣裳......火紅的衣裳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "抱歉，今天佩特拉奶奶格外激動，我或許不該帶你來見她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "我先扶她進屋，歌手，你等我一會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "歌手，你還在找那個在看你的人嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "沒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "還沒露面的麻煩，就像不敢露出牙齒的小獸。不用管。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "佩特拉奶奶她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "她知道彈琴，還知道跳舞。她說起話來就像外面的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "是這樣嗎？難怪，她說的很多東西，我都聽不懂哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "她叫我怪物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "她不是故意的。奶奶她經常看到不存在的東西，就像老在做夢一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......誰不是呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "她病了，沒法回答你問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "歌手，你不要著急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "我住的地方還有其他兄弟。我待會再帶你去問問他們。就是不知道他們願不願意開口。有時候真的很難和他們對話哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "兄弟？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "是啊，兄弟。你也是伊比利亞人，你們不這麼叫嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "我的媽媽並沒有其他孩子，不過，我有很多兄弟姐妹。城裡的大家，我們都是兄弟姐妹。這是律法說的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你們還信這些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "不然哩？在我小時候，還有佩特拉奶奶嘴裡的、過去那段黑暗的日子，我們曾經犯過錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "那時候大家都只顧著自己，躲在各自家裡，從來不說話。有時候挖出一個罐頭，我們還會，呃，打架。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "後來情況慢慢變好了。我們現在會住在一起，偶爾說話。大家開始，呃，學會分享。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "——“我們想活下去，所以我們更加愛彼此。因為愛，我們緊密相連。不能搶劫，不能爭鬥。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "“要使得自身強健，更要令族群更強健，這樣才能有更好的生活。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "這話聽著耳熟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "是嗎？教士說，外面的大家也都信這些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "忘了說，這些都是教士教給我們的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "每次他都會講好多......我大部分聽不大懂，除了上面那句話，就只記得要把大家都當成兄弟，要對大家都好一點。反正都是好話吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "教士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "是呀。他和你一樣，也是從外面來的。不過這是很多年前的事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "就是他來了以後，我們才變好了。他是我們中的一個兄弟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "他一個人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "大多數時候是一個人。哦，聽鐵皮他們說，後來還有另一個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "我沒見過呀。她不怎麼露面的。有時候教士和我們說話，那個人會站在他背後。我只遠遠地瞧過那麼一眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你怎麼......你這急急忙忙的，是要往哪裡去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我要去教堂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你知道怎麼去教堂嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你們的教堂，沒那麼難認。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "路不算好走哩。要從這裡一直走去海邊。來，我指給你看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你怎麼停下了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "居然跟過來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你在說什麼？我又聽不懂了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "那只黏人的小獸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "奇怪啊，你總說小獸，那應該是指動物吧？我們這裡沒有活著的動物，早就沒有啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "沒事，繼續走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "好吧，外面來的朋友，你說了算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你看到了嗎？就在那裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "不過我們一般不會在這個時候去教堂的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我有辦法進去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你可以進去，我們都可以。教堂的大門始終都為篤信之人打開，那個教士是這麼說的。可是......你是想去找人吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "他這時候一般不在教堂裡面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "他什麼時候在？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "每隔一段時間，他會主動出現在我們面前，親切地與我們每個人聊天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "有什麼問題的話，你也可以在那個時候去找他。無論你有什麼問題，他都不會拒絕你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "在那一天之內，到第二天太陽升起來之前，他都會待在教堂裡呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "對哦，他還可以幫你找人！那位教士的話，知道的肯定比我們多！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......一段時間是多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "唔，最近挺久沒見到他了。我不像他們，不怎麼數日子。可應該就這兩天吧？大家的食物都快吃光了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "奇怪，當你說好的時候，我老覺得你不像是真心答應。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "這不對，教士說了，我們不該懷疑他人。哎，他們都說我總是愛想各種問題，這樣對好的生活並沒有幫助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "這也是他說的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "哈哈，他可不會對我說這個，我早溜走哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "是鐵皮他們，大家都嫌我吵鬧。又不是我總想說這麼多話的。我們這裡的人，他們都太安靜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "當所有人都不說話的時候，我太無聊，就只好一個人說個不停了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "以前只有佩特拉奶奶總是陪我說話。現在還有你了，真好。哎呀，你會不會也嫌我煩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "在我來的地方，比你更愛說個不停的人有很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "這麼說的話，那一定是個好地方了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......是還行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "在你來的地方，人們會跳舞嗎？就像佩特拉奶奶說的那樣，廣場上的舞會？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "偶爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "那為什麼不見你跳舞呢？我看到你的琴了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "佩特拉奶奶和我說過。你們不是會邊唱邊跳嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我的舞蹈......你們不能看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "時間，場合，面前的人，都不對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你太奇怪了，簡直比我還要奇怪。你的家到底是哪裡？你來的地方，那裡的人都像你這麼奇怪嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（撥琴）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我來的地方，並不是家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我也不知道我家是哪裡了。我家已經沒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "那也沒什麼。我家也早就沒了，好幾年前一場大風，房子塌啦。我媽媽當時就在房間裡，她人也沒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "這也沒什麼。大家都這樣。房子沒了的話，再找一間沒人的就可以住下。這裡房子有的是哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "對了，你不高興跳舞的話，你會唱歌給我聽嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "我還沒聽過別人唱歌呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "或許。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "太好啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "哎，走了這麼多地方，我肚子都餓了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "你也一定餓了吧？餓著肚子的話，是不是也唱不動歌了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "我們去找吃的去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "是我跑得太快了嗎？我忘了你還不認識路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性居民",
      "text": "對了，我叫安妮塔！你以後可以喊我名字，這樣你就不會跟不上我了。你叫我一聲，我就會停下來等你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
